    {
      "id": "swer0rb",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9. Science and Technology"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0gu49y2",
      "content": "• Aryabhata discovered that the Earth rotates on its axis."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lwdd1ug",
      "content": "• The concept of zero was developed."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "s5iwk7v",
      "content": "• Advancements were made in astronomy and mathematics."
    },
    {
      "id": "mzc24kv",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "10. Decline of the Gupta Empire"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "w0xhdlb",
      "content": "• Weak successors after Skandagupta."
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
